<div id="urduTextPath">دربار/جب لٹ کے کربلا سے اسیرِ ستم چلے</div>

jab lut ke karbala se aseere sitam chale<br>
sajjad sar barahna ba dardo alam chale<br>
rote saro ko peet'te paabande gham chale<br>
zainab ne laashe sheh se kaha bhai ham chale<br>
<br>
marne se aap ke mai ye eeza uthaati hu<br>
darbar me yazeed ke sar nange jaati hu<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
hai hai mere musaafire karbobala hussain<br>
hai hai mere ghareeb mere mailaqa hussain<br>
hai hai tujhe na paani ka qatra mila hussain<br>
hai hai tamaam tan tera tukde hua hussain<br>
<br>
pyaase gale pa qanjare bedaad chal gaya<br>
hai hai tadap tadap ke tera dam nikal gaya<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
le nainawa ali ki bazaa'at tujhe mili<br>
aye karbala quda ki amaanat tujhe mili<br>
aye qaak meri maa ki riyazat tujhe mili<br>
le aye zameen shamme imaamat tujhe mili<br>
 <br>
daaman tera bhara meri kheti ujad gayi<br>
sarhad me tere bhai se zainab bichad gayi<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
ye kehke sar ko peet ke royi wo dil jali<br>
aakar najaf se haal mera dekho ya ali<br>
gardan rasan me aapki beti ki hai bandhi<br>
kehti ye maariya se wo baachashm-e-tar chali<br>
<br>
hai hai mai karbala-e mo'alla me lut gayi<br>
pardes me mai aake baraadar se chut gayi<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
kya lutf zindagi ka jo naqsha bigad gaya<br>
kyu kar na tadpu aah bada beej pad gaya<br>
is qaafele ka qaafele waala bichad gaya<br>
hai hai hamara kaisa bhara ghar ujad gaya<br>
<br>
pardesiyo ne chaauni jangal me chhaai hai <br>
bhai ne mere ek nayi basti basaai hai<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
mehmaa'n bulaake ham se dagha ki layeeno ne<br>
kya kya ham pe joro jafa ki layeeno ne<br>
kuch bhi zara na sharmo haya ki layeeno ne<br>
gardan qifa se sheh ki juda ki layeeno ne<br>
<br>
qaima jala ke ahle sitam shaad ho gaye<br>
ham karbala me aan ke barbaad ho gaye<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
bhai pa mere saamne naize chala kiye<br>
tegho tabar badan pa baraabar laga kiye<br>
shabbir shukr shukr hi mu se kaha kiye<br>
utra na shimr seene se besar juda kiye<br>
<br>
roti rahi mai wo sare shabbir le gaya<br>
bhai ki mere qoo'n bhari tasweer le gaya<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
faryaad ham ghareebo ki sunta nahi koyi<br>
kis se kahe'n jo ham pa museebat guzar gayi<br>
chaadar bhi mu chupaane ko sar par nahi rahi<br>
sar khole shehre shaam me aayi mai dil jali<br>
<br>
aada hame dikhaake sare sheh rulaate hai<br>
ab saamne shaqi ke mujhe leke jaate hai